        "title_top": "",
        "title": "Expert Backed Review Summary",
        "text": "<p>Timeline Mitopure Dewy Cream is designed for users who want meaningful hydration and anti-aging skincare in a lighter daily moisturizer. Unlike heavier barrier creams, its lightweight texture absorbs quickly and leaves skin with a dewy, healthy-looking finish, making it practical for both morning and evening routines. The standout ingredient is <strong>Mitopure®</strong>, Timeline's patented form of Urolithin A. The brand positions this bioactive around supporting mitochondrial function in skin, while the overall formula is designed to improve hydration, barrier function, and the visible signs associated with skin aging. Mitopure is supported by a complementary blend of <strong>peptides, niacinamide, and sodium hyaluronate</strong>. The peptide complex is formulated to support skin renewal and address the appearance of wrinkles and elasticity, while niacinamide helps support the skin barrier and more even-looking tone. Sodium hyaluronate works as a moisture-binding ingredient to help skin feel softer and appear plumper. </p><p></p>",
        "body_align": "center",
        "content_width": "narrow",
        "align-heading": "center",
